{"id":"00454","root":"uni00454_1","name":{"ja":"由利　翡翠","en":"Yuri Hisui"},"title":{"ja":"【翡色の疾風】","en":"【Jade on the Beach】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【翡色の疾風】 由利　翡翠","en":"【Jade on the Beach】 Yuri Hisui"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2021-04-30","limited":true,"characterId":32,"profile":{"ja":"主に前線での戦闘任務にあたる対魔忍。任務以外ではボーッとしていて、訓練などでも目立つことはない。だが、いざ戦闘となると忍法の特性を生かし、驚くほど執念深い戦いを見せる。そのギャップと口下手な性格からか、親しく付き合う友人などもおらず、基本的には一人で居る事が多い。ただ、本人は決して人嫌いなわけではなく、仲間意識も強いタイプで、仲間を傷つける者には一切の容赦を見せない。普段は非常に質素な生活を送っていて趣味もこれといってないが、餌付けした野鳥と戯れるのを日課としている対魔忍として成果を上げている翡翠だが、術の特性から、特に戦闘序盤においては防御主体になりがちである。そこで基礎攻撃力を高め、また防御の力も向上させたいと、新たな対魔忍スーツと武器が試作される。既存の対魔忍スーツと錫杖をベースに改良を加えたこの装備で翡翠の戦闘能力は更に向上する。翡翠はフィッティングのあと、試しに訓練に行ってくると宣言し意気揚々とどこかへ向かうのだった。","en":"She is a Taimanin primarily assigned to frontline combat missions. Outside of missions she zones out and doesn't stand out even in training. However, when battle begins she utilizes the traits of her ninjutsu to display astonishingly tenacious fighting. Because of this gap and her poor social skills, she has no close friends and usually spends time alone. She is not a misanthrope; she has a strong sense of camaraderie and shows no mercy to anyone who harms her comrades. She leads a very modest life with no particular hobbies, but she makes feeding wild birds a daily routine, which has helped her excel as a Taimanin. Due to the nature of her techniques, she tends to be defense-oriented especially early in combat. Wanting to raise her base attack and improve her defense, new Taimanin suits and weapons are being prototyped. This equipment, based on existing Taimanin suits and a tin staff with upgrades, further enhances her combat abilities. After fitting, she declares she'll go test it in training, and heads off with confidence."},"illustrator":"柄あゆり","voiceActor":"疾風はる","forms":[{"id":"uni00454_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1222,2444],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[131,262]